  "wikitext": "{|class=\"wikitable\" style=\"float:right;\"\n!Blueprint Requirements\n|-\n| 100,000x [[Aluminum]], 1,000,000x [[steel]], 100,000x [[Rubber]]\n|}\n\nImproves all [[Oil refinery|Oil refineries]] of a [[corporation]] in the [[region]] it is installed in to produce 1x [[Jet fuel]] instead of 1x [[Gasoline]] every 30 seconds. This is the only way to produce [[Jet fuel]].\n\nThe u version makes it produce 1x [[Jet fuel]] in 8 seconds instead of 30 seconds.\n\n[[Category:Asset]]\n[[Category:Technology]]",
